            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, MiniMax uses 'mini.deps' and it supports [freezing](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-deps.html#minideps-overview-freeze) by setting `checkout` to a particular commit hash, tag, or indeed `'HEAD'` string to freeze at current state.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, MiniMax uses 'mini.deps' and it supports <a href=\"https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-deps.html#minideps-overview-freeze\" rel=\"nofollow\">freezing</a> by setting <code class=\"notranslate\">checkout</code> to a particular commit hash, tag, or indeed <code class=\"notranslate\">'HEAD'</code> string to freeze at current state.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Yes, MiniMax uses 'mini.deps' and it supports freezing by setting checkout to a particular commit hash, tag, or indeed 'HEAD' string to freeze at current state.",
